        }
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "3x/4 = 7/8 × 288 = 252 gives x = 336; digit sum = 3 + 3 + 6 = 12."
    },
    {
      "id": "06-070",
      "number": 70,
      "question": "Four positive numbers total 180. Adding 5 to the first, subtracting 5 from the second, doubling the third and halving the fourth all give the same result. Find the second number.",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "text": "20"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "text": "35"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "text": "80"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "text": "45"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "D",
      "explanation": "With common result k, the sum = (k − 5) + (k + 5) + k/2 + 2k = 9k/2 = 180; k = 40 and the second number is 45."
    },
    {
      "id": "06-071",
      "number": 71,
      "question": "Two positive numbers are in the ratio 7 : 11. Subtracting the smaller from 3 times the larger gives 208. Find the smaller number.",
