          "text": "77"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "text": "49"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "(33 − 7)k = 208 gives k = 8; smaller = 7 × 8 = 56."
    },
    {
      "id": "06-072",
      "number": 72,
      "question": "The sum of four consecutive integers is 230. What is the sum of the next four consecutive integers?",
